message.content:
Here’s the JSON request you can send to invoke the `runIt` method with your `testArgs` array and log the output to `System.out`:

```json
{
  "name": "clear001a_runIt",
  "arguments": {
    "args": "testArgs",
    "out": "System.out"
  }
}
```

Just copy this into your tool invocation and it will create the object, hit the breakpoint, and write the results to the standard output stream.

